<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cascade downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cascade downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it downgraded Cascade Communications Corp to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock sank 20-5/8 to 43-5/8. Analysts cited concerns about slowing growth in the company's core switching business and an unexpected rise in accounts receivables in the fourth quarter.</p>
</text>
